{
  "$comment": [
    "FND-05 deliverable 1 — the event type registry: type -> current version -> schema path, for both",
    "transports (sub-PRD D8). schemas.test.ts walks schemas/events/**/*.json and compares BOTH",
    "directions: a schema file absent from this registry fails, and a registry entry with no file fails.",
    "",
    "Paths are relative to this file's directory and always use forward slashes.",
    "",
    "Adding a type is additive within v1 (PRD §16.1) and happens HERE, together with its schema — never",
    "inside the requesting module's own tree (FND-05 Feedback obligation 2). Removing or renaming a",
    "property, or changing a meaning, mints schemas/events/<transport>/v2/** and bumps schema_version;",
    "packages/contracts/test/events/baseline/v1.json is what makes that mechanical."
  ],
  "webhook": {
    "envelope": {
      "schema": "webhook/v1/envelope.json",
      "version": "v1",
      "schema_version": "1.0"
    },
    "types": {
      "alert.created": {
        "schema": "webhook/v1/alert.created.json",
        "version": "v1",
        "schema_version": "1.0"
      }
    }
  },
  "sse": {
